  "description": "The fully managed, zero-native-dependency companion of CodeBrix.Imaging.Drawing: the same stroke-based drawing, painting and highlighting API, SkiaSharp-workalike drawing types (DrawingCanvas, DrawingBitmap, DrawingPaint, DrawingPath, gradients, blend modes, clipping, save-layers), and SVG rendering - all rasterized entirely in managed code on CodeBrix.Imaging pixel buffers. No SkiaSharp, no Skia native libraries, no native dependencies of any kind. Reference EITHER this package OR CodeBrix.Imaging.Drawing.ApacheLicenseForever, never both: they compile the same drawing-session sources into the same namespaces.",
